@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor Black
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor LightBlue

title Registro de Propriedade - Parte 1: Solicitação

actor "Usuário\n(Proprietário)" as User
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "BFF Gateway" as BFF
participant "Orchestrator" as Orch
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "Queue Worker" as QW
participant "Offchain\nConsumer" as OC
participant "Blockchain\n(Besu)" as BC
participant "Event\nListener" as EL

User -> FE: Preenche formulário de registro\n{matriculaId, endereço, metragem, ...}
activate FE

FE -> BFF: POST /api/properties/register\n{matriculaId, proprietario, ...}
activate BFF

BFF -> Orch: Proxy: POST /properties/register\n+ JWT validation
activate Orch

Orch -> Orch: Validar dados de entrada\n(matricula única, campos obrigatórios)

Orch -> DB: SELECT * FROM properties\nWHERE matricula_id = ?
activate DB
DB --> Orch: Not found
deactivate DB

Orch -> DB: INSERT INTO properties\n(matricula_id, proprietario, ...)\nstatus = PENDENTE
activate DB
DB --> Orch: Property ID created
deactivate DB

Orch -> MQ: Publish REGISTER_PROPERTY job\n{propertyId, matriculaId, beneficiary, ...}
activate MQ
deactivate MQ

Orch -> DB: UPDATE properties\nSET status = PROCESSANDO_REGISTRO
activate DB
deactivate DB

Orch --> BFF: 201 Created\n{propertyId, status: "PROCESSANDO_REGISTRO"}
deactivate Orch

BFF --> FE: Property registration initiated
deactivate BFF

FE --> User: "Propriedade em processamento.\nAguardando confirmação na blockchain..."
deactivate FE

== Processamento Assíncrono ==

MQ --> QW: Consume REGISTER_PROPERTY job
activate QW

QW -> OC: POST /api/properties/register\n{matriculaId, beneficiary, ...}
activate OC

OC -> OC: Build transaction:\nrequestPropertyRegistration(\n  matricula,\n  beneficiary\n)

OC -> BC: Submit transaction to Besu
activate BC

BC --> OC: Transaction Hash: 0xabc123...
OC --> QW: {requestHash, txHash}
deactivate QW

BC -> BC: Mine transaction\n(QBFT consensus)

BC -> BC: Calculate requestHash:\nkeccak256(beneficiary, matricula)

BC -> BC: Store in pendingRegistrations[requestHash]:\n{\n  matricula, beneficiary,\n  requester, requestedAt,\n  exists: true,\n  financialApproved: false,\n  registryOfficeApproved: false,\n  municipalityApproved: false,\n  executed: false\n}

BC -> BC: **Emit RegistrationRequested**\n{\n  requestHash,\n  matricula,\n  beneficiary,\n  requester\n}

BC --> EL: Event detected
deactivate BC
activate EL

EL -> EL: Parse event:\n- event.args[0] = requestHash\n- event.args[1] = matricula\n- event.args[2] = beneficiary\n- event.transactionHash

EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/blockchain/properties/\nregistration-requested\n{\n  requestHash,\n  matriculaId,\n  beneficiary,\n  transactionHash\n}
activate Orch

Orch -> DB: UPDATE properties\nSET request_hash = ?,\n    blockchain_tx_hash = ?\nWHERE matricula_id = ?
activate DB
DB --> Orch: Updated
deactivate DB

Orch --> EL: 200 OK
deactivate Orch
deactivate EL

note over User, BC
**STATUS ATUAL:**
- Propriedade: PROCESSANDO_REGISTRO
- request_hash: preenchido
- blockchain_tx_hash: preenchido
- Aguardando 3 aprovações (parte 2)
end note

@enduml
